from the individual event – " [:a {:href "/athletes/34889"} "Daniele Masala"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/34890"} "Carlo Massullo"] " and were led by them as they won the gold medal. Italy and the United States finished one-two in the riding, the first phase, and they stayed that way through all four days of competition, with the USA winning silver, followed by France in third place, which was their first Olympic pentathlon medal. Sweden was close after three events, but was eliminated from contention when " [:a {:href "/athletes/35076"} "Roderick Martin"] " was disqualified in the shooting. He failed to shoot at one target and then shot twice at the next."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Team Points"] [:th {} "Individual Points"] [:th {} "Riding"] [:th {} "Fencing"] [:th {} "Swimming"] [:th {} "Shooting"] [:th {} "Running"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Italy"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ITA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ITA.png"}] "ITA"]] [:td {} "16,060"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "3,240 (1)"] [:td {} "2,560 (4)"] [:td {} "3,716 (4)"] [:td {} "2,912 (4)"] [:td {} "3,632 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/34889"} "Daniele Masala"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "16,060"] [:td {} "5,469"] [:td {} "3,240"] [:td {} "2,560"] [:td {} "3,716"] [:td {} "2,912"] [:td {} "3,632"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/34890"} "Carlo Massullo"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "16,060"] [:td {} "5,406"] [:td {} "3,240"] [:td {} "2,560"] [:td {} "3,716"] [:td {} "2,912"] [:td {} "3,632"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/34882"} "Pierpaolo C